{
  "id": "p01",
  "title": "A Saturday by the River",
  "titleZh": "河边的星期六",
  "topic": "日常",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My son talks baseball over a quick Saturday breakfast at home.",
        "zh": "在家里的周六早餐上，我儿子三句不离棒球。"
      },
      {
        "en": "At fourteen he joins a small club near our quiet street.",
        "zh": "十四岁时，他加入了我们安静街道附近的一个小俱乐部。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My daughter, still tiny, mimics every swing he makes at home.",
        "zh": "我女儿还很小，却模仿他每一次挥棒。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our group meets each Saturday for one full hour by the gate.",
        "zh": "我们这一组每个周六都在大门边聚满整整一小时。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then his coach calls to say they practice by our river today.",
        "zh": "然后他的教练打来电话，说他们今天在我们这条河边练习。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He begs me to come along, and I promise to be there.",
        "zh": "他求我一起去，我答应他一定到场。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I pour bitter coffee and watch a pale moon slowly fade.",
        "zh": "我倒上苦咖啡，看着苍白的月亮慢慢褪去。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One early phone call from work spoils our peace at dawn.",
        "zh": "一早来自工作的一通电话破坏了黎明的安宁。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My boss needs an urgent appointment in a distant office unit.",
        "zh": "我的老板要我在一个遥远的办公室单位赴一个紧急约见。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The old car will not start, no taxi is cheap.",
        "zh": "那辆旧车发动不了，而打车也不便宜。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "I can almost afford an expensive trip across our town.",
        "zh": "我几乎付得起横穿我们镇的一趟昂贵行程。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My tired head begins to spin with a familiar heavy weight.",
        "zh": "我疲惫的脑袋开始发晕，带着一种熟悉的沉重。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I step outside quietly; I lock our rusty front door.",
        "zh": "我悄悄走到外面，锁上我们生锈的前门。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A lady across our road struggles with a heavy pet.",
        "zh": "我们路对面，一位女士正费力地牵着一只沉重的宠物。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I help her, then sprint home before my hope dies.",
        "zh": "我帮了她，然后一路跑回家，赶在我的希望熄灭之前。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My enemy is time, which rarely plays fair with me.",
        "zh": "我的敌人是时间，它对我很少公平。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I suppose I could cancel, but that feels deeply wrong.",
        "zh": "我想我可以取消，但那感觉大错特错。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A memory returns of a lie my father once told me.",
        "zh": "我想起父亲曾对我说过的一个谎言。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I call my boss, or I continue to wait in silence.",
        "zh": "我给老板打电话，或者继续默默地等。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During my short call, my boss waits there with a guest.",
        "zh": "在我简短的通话期间，老板带着一位客人在那边等着。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Soon we spend our morning as his game finds its course.",
        "zh": "很快，我们度过这个上午，他的比赛也慢慢成形。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I watch my son's game develop from a quiet wooden bench.",
        "zh": "我坐在安静的木凳上，看着儿子的比赛逐渐展开。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later we rest past our university under a wide old tree.",
        "zh": "后来我们在我们大学过去一点的一棵大老树下休息。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Nothing can prevent a rich, unhurried morning like this now.",
        "zh": "现在没有什么能阻止这个富足而从容的早晨。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A quick jump separates us; he grabs a high ball.",
        "zh": "一个快速的跳跃把我们分开；他扑向一个高球。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My favourite ball flies far; I taste fresh cool morning air.",
        "zh": "我最喜欢的球飞得很远；我尝到清晨清凉的空气。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An accident sends it far downstream; my neck burns.",
        "zh": "一场意外把它送往下游很远；我的脖子火辣辣地疼。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Let that ball sail away downriver; my promise still stands.",
        "zh": "让那个球顺流漂走吧；我的承诺依然立着。"
      }
    ]
  ],
